{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantastic universe, form a group of up to 5 dwarves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class then set off on an adventure in mines and galleries. Your goal is to extract materials there. However one of you finds yourself infected, and becomes a creature whose goal is to prevent his former colleagues from leaving again... Survive by working as a team but also by using your environment, your equipment and your skills to escape and trick your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the monster's point of view you must evolve, move on the walls and ceilings. Use your skills to set traps, locate them, hide or hit your targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the hunter or the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Lobby </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Cosmetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to Unlock</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3112420?t=1766844794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/694f1657c9391a0f11e49756571e234abd6e05b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766844794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/f362e487dd052621adfa2450de39c2cee23a8448/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766844794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/f362e487dd052621adfa2450de39c2cee23a8448/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766844794","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a fantastic universe, form a group of up to 5 dwarves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a class then set off on an adventure in mines and galleries. Your goal is to extract materials there. However one of you finds yourself infected, and becomes a creature whose goal is to prevent his former colleagues from leaving again... Survive by working as a team but also by using your environment, your equipment and your skills to escape and trick your worst nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the monster's point of view you must evolve, move on the walls and ceilings. Use your skills to set traps, locate them, hide or hit your targets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the hunter or the prey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Lobby </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Cosmetics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to Unlock</p></li></ul>","developers":["HanoriaStudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3112420/2331fdaa9554ec5889a7d463b4169202c7479176/header.jpg?t=1766844794","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3112420/756027/a250a0c9d9e9209b415211edab8ed245cc874fda/1750871739/dash_av1.mpd?t=1726417836","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3112420/756027